{"id":"c002c74ab8e3928a","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Dense Set","display":"df-zfc-forcing-dense-set — ZFC Forcing Dense Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set","58-df-zfc-forcing2-dense-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-dense-set — ZFC Forcing Dense Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing2-dense-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-dense-set — ZFC Forcing Dense Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P\\neq\\varnothing\\land\nD\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P\\neq\\varnothing\\land\nD\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order is an explicit predicate argument; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\">\\(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\)</span> follows the forcing convention that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> is stronger than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing2-dense-subset</code> is merged here; it used the same dense-subset condition with an explicit order parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P\\neq\\varnothing\\land\nD\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p)","display":true},{"tex":"q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1118,"backlinks":[{"id":"6be5dd5cd3f808f8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S$ (dense-subset predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1956","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}